Dependencies (not included in this repository)
----------------------------------------------

adk-rust v3 (https://github.com/zavora-ai/adk-rust), Zavora's Rust agent framework, is fetched
by Cargo at a pinned commit and is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Other Rust crates and
Dart packages are fetched by Cargo and pub under their own licences, listed in Cargo.lock and
apps/pubspec.lock.

The fixture runs the official wordpress and mariadb container images, and the sealed-room
images are built from public base images named in each Dockerfile under
crates/agentrix-sandbox/images/. None of those images is included here.
